/* =========================================================================
====    ()_()                                                  ()_()    ====
====    (o.0)         EMVs - Ecole des métiers du Valais       (0.o)    ====
====    (m)(m)                                                (m)(m)    ====
============================================================================
====                                                                    ====
====                     Programmation en langage C                     ====
====                     --------------------------                     ====
